  <!-- A small marked network for the TrailGraph. Comments give each node's
       (east, north) metres from A at 46.05, 14.05.

       Lake Loop (2001): a 4 km RoundTrip A - B - C - K - A, parking by A.
       Summit Line (2002): A - D - P, 2.7 km up to Grey Peak; D is a Junction
         because the Spur Zuweg (2003, 500 m, too short for a DayHike) leaves it.
       Connector (2004): F - M; F is a dead end 12 m from G on the Lake Loop
         with no node in common: the snap joins F to G with a gap Segment.
       Cross Trail (2005): crosses the Spur at (-1000, 850) with no node there:
         the TrailGraph puts a node at the crossing.
       Bridge Path (2006): a bridge over the Summit Line: never joined to it.
       Meadow Path (2007): passes 15 m from the Lake Loop at Z2 with no
         connection near it: a Link Z2 - S1 is offered, not walked. -->
